      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate bug report of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/cant-load-images-or-most-avatars - it's the Intel Killer issue again, with SSL errors according to logs.\n\n@{6a818899523ad1613330f8ba|full_name} Hi, it looks like you may have submitted a user support request to the incorrect channel. Bug reports would have steps to reproduce, an expected and actual result, and are not related to your own setup (as in this case, your network configuration or traffic shaping programs on your operating system causing SSL errors).\n\nParticularly, your **Acer Nitro ANV16-72** laptop comes with an Intel Killer Wi-Fi 6 AX1650i for wireless connectivity and an unspecified Ethernet network interface card for wired connectivity.\n\n**Disable/end the Intel Killer Network service/task in your operating system.**\n\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360062658433-Troubleshooting-Connection-Issues-with-VRChat\n\nFor isolated issues or customer support visit https://help.vrchat.com/",
